flowchart TB
  trig{{push · pull_request<br/>workflow_dispatch}}:::gate --> test
  test[test<br/><small>ubuntu-latest</small>]:::cloud --> build[build<br/><small>self-hosted</small>]:::job
  build -->|not a PR| dd[deploy-dev<br/>env: development]:::dev
